   "heading": "GAUSSIAN FLUCTUATIONS OF JACK-DEFORMED RANDOM YOUNG DIAGRAMS 1. I NTRODUCTION 1.1. Random partitions. . . An integer partition , called also a Young diagram , is a weakly decreasing ﬁnite sequence λ = ( λ 1 , . . . , λ l ) of positive integers λ 1 ≥· · · ≥ λ l > 0 . We also say that λ is a partition",
